<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AJ Digital AI | Digital Solutions</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#101010;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
header{padding:20px;background:#080808;border-bottom:1px solid #d4af37}
.brand{color:#d4af37;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold}
nav{margin-top:12px}
nav a{color:white;margin-right:15px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:75px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111,#29200c)}
h1{font-size:42px;line-height:1.2}
.gold{color:#d4af37}
p{color:#ccc}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#d4af37;color:#111;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin:8px 4px}
section{padding:45px 20px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
h2{color:#d4af37}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:15px}
.card{background:#1c1c1c;border:1px solid #55451e;padding:20px;border-radius:10px}
.price{color:#d4af37;font-weight:bold}
.sample{background:#211b0e;border:1px solid #d4af37;padding:25px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;margin:8px 0;background:#202020;color:white;border:1px solid #80651e;border-radius:5px}
button{background:#d4af37;color:#111;padding:14px;border:0;border-radius:5px;font-weight:bold;width:100%;font-size:16px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:#080808;color:#d4af37}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="brand">AJ DIGITAL AI</div>
<small>Your Business. Digitally Elevated.</small>
<nav>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#portfolio">Portfolio</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
<p class="gold">DESIGN • TECHNOLOGY • INNOVATION</p>
<h1>Your Business.<br><span class="gold">Digitally Elevated.</span></h1>
<p>We help Ugandan businesses grow through creative design, technology and AI-powered digital solutions.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#contact">Start a Project</a>
<a class="btn" href="#services">Our Services</a>
</div>

<section id="services">
<h2>Our Services</h2>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Graphic Design</h3><p>Posters, flyers and adverts.</p><div class="price">From UGX 10,000</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Branding</h3><p>Logo concepts and business identity.</p><div class="price">From UGX 20,000</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Promotional Videos</h3><p>TikTok and social media videos.</p><div class="price">From UGX 25,000</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Digital Catalogues</h3><p>Professional product catalogues.</p><div class="price">From UGX 30,000</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Website Development</h3><p>Mobile-friendly business websites.</p><div class="price">From UGX 60,000</div></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Social Media Content</h3><p>Business content and captions.</p><div class="price">From UGX 20,000</div></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="portfolio">
<h2>Our Portfolio</h2>
<p>Some of the creative projects we can produce for your business.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="sample"><h3 class="gold">HARDWARE PROMOTION</h3><p>Tools that get the job done.</p></div>
<div class="sample"><h3 class="gold">FASHION PROMOTION</h3><p>Your style. Your statement.</p></div>
<div class="sample"><h3 class="gold">RESTAURANT PROMOTION</h3><p>Good food. Great moments.</p></div>
<div class="sample"><h3 class="gold">SALON PROMOTION</h3><p>Look good. Feel confident.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Let's Work Together</h2>
<p>Tell us what your business needs. Your enquiry will open directly in WhatsApp.</p>
<form id="orderForm">
<input id="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
<input id="business" placeholder="Business name">
<select id="service">
<option>Graphic design</option>
<option>Logo and branding</option>
<option>Promotional video</option>
<option>Digital catalogue</option>
<option>Website development</option>
<option>Social media content</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
<textarea id="details" placeholder="Describe what you need"></textarea>
<button type="submit">Send Enquiry on WhatsApp</button>
</form>
</section>

<footer>
<strong>AJ DIGITAL AI</strong>
<p>Your Business. Digitally Elevated.</p>
<p>Uganda | +256 749 783 087</p>
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById("orderForm").addEventListener("submit",function(e){
e.preventDefault();
const name=document.getElementById("name").value;
const business=document.getElementById("business").value;
const service=document.getElementById("service").value;
const details=document.getElementById("details").value;
const message=`Hello AJ Digital AI! My name is ${name}. Business: ${business}. Service: ${service}. Details: ${details}`;
window.open("https://wa.me/256749783087?text="+encodeURIComponent(message),"_blank");
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
